  <ferc:MethodsOfAllocationTextBlock id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.794%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:48.900%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:48.900%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;Service Department or Function&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Basis of Allocation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;All service departments or functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Direct Assignment - where an expense can be directly attributed to an associate company, it is directly assigned. The 2025 costs by service department were allocated via this allocation to Sempra Infrastructure Services Company, LLC, the immediate parent company of Sempra Services Corporation.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Causal/Beneficial - functions supporting multiple&lt;br/&gt;associate companies are allocated using a causal/beneficial factor. This allocation method is applied for the remaining attributable costs to the associate companies after direct assignment. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Retained - expenses that are not attributable to any&lt;br/&gt;other associate companies. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;</ferc:MethodsOfAllocationTextBlock>
